
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
@orderId = YOUR_PENDING_ORDER_ID

### 1. Thanh toán thành công
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payment-demo-001
X-Mock-Outcome: SUCCESS

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "E_WALLET"
}

### 2. Gửi lại cùng key và cùng nội dung
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payment-demo-001
X-Mock-Outcome: FAILED

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "E_WALLET"
}

### 3. Thanh toán thất bại bằng key mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payment-demo-002
X-Mock-Outcome: FAILED

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "BANK_CARD"
}

### 4. Cùng key nhưng khác nội dung
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payment-demo-001
X-Mock-Outcome: SUCCESS

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "BANK_CARD"
}
